    "%lld Selected" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已选择 %lld 张"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld were already in Pictures and were left as they are." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld 张已经在“图片”里，保持原样。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "© %@ %@. Apricot SSTV is free software: you can redistribute it and modify it under the terms of the GNU General Public License, version 3. It comes with no warranty. Its decoder began as Apricot SSTV for the iPod nano." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "© %1$@ %2$@。Apricot SSTV 是自由软件：你可以依照 GNU 通用公共许可证第 3 版的条款重新分发和修改它。本软件不提供任何担保。它的解码器源自 iPod nano 版的 Apricot SSTV。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "12 kHz" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "12 kHz"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A missed start" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "漏掉了开头"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A picture can keep the sound it was decoded from. A bad one is then developed again from that sound, not bent or retouched as an image: every pixel still comes from the signal." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每张图片都可以保留它解码时的声音。收得不好的图片可以用这段声音重新冲洗，而不是对图像做变形或修饰：每个像素仍然来自信号本身。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A picture was sent but nothing happened." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有人发了图片，但没有反应。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A start too short to count as a picture, mostly a false start, is kept as a fragment, with its raw audio. Its sound may hold a whole picture whose start was missed. Fragments are shown apart: choose Fragments in the menu at the top right of Pictures." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "太短、算不上一张图的接收（多半是误触发）会作为片段连同原始音频一起保存。它的声音里可能有一整张错过了开头的图。片段单独显示：在“图片”页右上角的菜单里选“片段”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关于"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About 8 MB for a Martin M1 picture." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一张 Martin M1 图片约 8 MB。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About Apricot SSTV" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关于 Apricot SSTV"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add to Event" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "加入活动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add to Favorites" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "添加到常用图片"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adjust Photo" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "调整照片"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adjust Position and Size" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "调整位置和大小"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adjust the radio's volume so the Level bar stays in the green, between the −40 and −10 dB marks. The red stretch at the right end means it's about to clip: if the bar turns red and says Clipping, turn the radio down." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "调节电台音量，让“电平”条保持在绿色，大约在 −40 和 −10 dB 两个刻度之间。最右端的红色区段表示快要削波了：如果电平条变红并显示“削波”，就把电台音量调小。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After you tap Listen and lower your wrist:" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "轻点“接收”并放下手腕后："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All Pictures" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "全部图片"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An event gathers the pictures of one occasion, such as an ISS SSTV weekend or a net. Make one current, and pictures received from then on, here or on Apple Watch, go into it until the end of its last day. Others can be added with Select in Pictures. An event's pictures are grouped by when they came in: a gap of more than 20 minutes starts a new group." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "活动用来归拢同一场合的图片，比如一次 ISS SSTV 活动或一次网络点名。把它设为当前活动后，之后在这台 iPhone 或 Apple Watch 上收到的图片都会归入，直到最后一天结束。其他图片可以在“图片”页用“选择”加入。活动里的图片按接收时间分组：间隔超过 20 分钟就另起一组。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An event gathers the pictures of one occasion: an ISS SSTV weekend, a net, a test with a friend. While one is current, new pictures go into it by themselves." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "活动用来归拢同一场合收到的图片：一次 ISS SSTV 活动、一次网络点名、和朋友的一次测试。设为当前活动后，新收到的图片会自动归入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Watch" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple Watch"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apply" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "应用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apricot SSTV" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apricot SSTV"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apricot SSTV collects no data." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apricot SSTV 不收集任何数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apricot SSTV turns the sound of slow-scan television into pictures. Tune your radio to a frequency where SSTV is sent, and let your iPhone or Apple Watch hear it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apricot SSTV 能把慢扫描电视（SSTV）的声音还原成图片。把电台调到有 SSTV 信号的频率，让 iPhone 或 Apple Watch 听到它就行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Audio" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "音频"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Audio File" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "音频文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Audio lost" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "丢失的音频"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Automatic" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "自动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Automatic finds the mode from each picture's VIS header. Choose a mode to receive only that one. Start Without VIS locks on to the line syncs when the header was missed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“自动”会根据每张图片的 VIS 头识别模式。选择某个模式则只接收这一种。“无 VIS 也开始”会在漏掉 VIS 头时按行同步锁定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Automatic suits most listening. If you know what's coming, such as PD120 from the International Space Station, choose that mode in Settings or the ⋯ menu on Receive. Other modes are then ignored, which also avoids false starts in noise." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "大多数情况下用“自动”即可。如果你知道将要收到什么，例如国际空间站的 PD120，可以在“设置”或“接收”页的 ⋯ 菜单中选择该模式。之后其他模式会被忽略，这也能避免在噪声中误触发。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Built In" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "内置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "By %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "作者：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "By hand" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "手动调整"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Callsign" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "呼号"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Can't send: %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法发送：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Can't start: %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法开始：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Cancel" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "取消"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Center" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "居中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Change Picture" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "更换图片"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check before going on the air" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "发射前先检查"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Check that the Level bar moves, that Mode is Automatic or matches the picture, and that the tuning marker sits near 1900 Hz during the VIS header. Weak or distorted audio can hide the header; Start Without VIS helps." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "检查电平条是否在动、模式是否为“自动”或与图片一致，以及 VIS 头期间调谐标记是否在 1900 Hz 附近。音频太弱或失真可能听不出 VIS 头，这时“无 VIS 也开始”会有帮助。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a mode to receive only that one. Start Without VIS locks on to the line syncs when the header was missed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "选择一种模式后只接收这一种。“无 VIS 也开始”会在漏掉 VIS 头时按行同步锁定开始。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a Picture" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "选择图片"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a picture from the photo library, Favorites or Files, then tap it to move and zoom it in the frame. Favorites keeps pictures you send often, each where you last placed it, and two test cards for trying out a setup. Your callsign is drawn at the top left; add a second line, such as a signal report, if you like." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "从照片图库、“常用图片”或“文件”中选择一张图片，然后轻点它，在画框中移动和缩放。“常用图片”保存你经常发送的图片，每张都记得上次放置的位置，另外还有两张测试卡，用来检验设备连接。你的呼号画在左上角；如果需要，可以再加一行文字，比如信号报告。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose a picture to send." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "选择一张要发送的图片。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose All Pictures in the menu at the top right." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在右上角的菜单中选择“全部图片”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choose Picture" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "选择图片"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Choosing a mode" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "选择模式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clear Picture" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "清除图片"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "CLIP" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "削波"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clipping" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "削波"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clock" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "时钟"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clock Error" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "时钟偏差"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Color Bars" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "彩条"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Complete" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "完整"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connect the audio" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "连接音频"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connect the audio output (headphone adapter or USB interface) to the radio's audio input; the iPhone's volume sets the level. Before sending on the air with a new setup, share a WAV (top left) and check it with another SSTV decoder." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将音频输出（耳机转接器或 USB 声卡）连接到电台的音频输入，用 iPhone 的音量调节电平。使用新设置正式发射前，请先分享一个 WAV 文件（左上角），并用其他 SSTV 解码器检查。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connect the iPhone's audio output (a headphone adapter or a USB audio interface) to the radio's microphone or data input, and turn on VOX so the radio transmits when it hears the audio. The iPhone's volume sets the level: start low and raise it until the radio's ALC just begins to move." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "把 iPhone 的音频输出（耳机转接器或 USB 声卡）接到电台的话筒或数据输入，并打开 VOX，让电台听到音频时自动发射。用 iPhone 的音量调节电平：从小音量开始，逐渐调大，直到电台的 ALC 刚开始动作。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connect the radio" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "连接电台"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Continue" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "继续"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Could not write image.png" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法写入 image.png"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Couldn't Make the WAV" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法生成 WAV"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Couldn't Open the Picture" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法打开图片"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Current" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当前"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Current Event" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当前活动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Darkroom" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "暗室"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Decode Audio File" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "解码音频文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Decode Audio File, in the ⋯ menu on Receive, finds the pictures in a recording made with another device or app (WAV, M4A, MP3 and others), as if it were played to Receive. Each is saved in Pictures with its stretch of the recording as raw audio, to develop again in the darkroom; its note says which file it came from. The file itself isn't changed. (Import Library, in Settings, is something else: it takes back a folder this app exported.)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“接收”页 ⋯ 菜单里的“解码音频文件”可以从别的设备或软件录下的录音（WAV、M4A、MP3 等）里找出图片，就像把它放给“接收”听一样。每张图片都会存进“图片”，并带上录音中属于它的那一段作为原始音频，可以在暗室里重新冲洗；它的备注会写明来自哪个文件。原文件不会被改动。（“设置”里的“导入资料库”是另一回事：它用来导回本 app 导出的文件夹。）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Decode Audio File…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "解码音频文件…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Decoded from the audio file “%@”, at %@ into it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "解码自音频文件“%1$@”，位于 %2$@ 处。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "decoder could not start" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "解码器无法启动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Decodes the whole raw audio again with the latest decoder: the slant fitted over the whole picture, weak lines carried through. Then adjust it by hand below. Everything here works on the sound, not on the image: each change reads the signal again, so nothing is stretched or made up." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用最新的解码器把整段原始音频重新解码：在整张图上拟合斜度，弱信号的行也能接着解下去。然后可以在下面手动调整。这里的一切都作用于声音而不是图像：每次改动都会重新读取信号，没有任何拉伸或凭空生成。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Decodes the whole recording with the latest decoder: the slant fitted over the whole picture, syncs found where the first decode missed them, weak lines carried through. Often that's all a picture needs." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用最新的解码器把整段录音重新解码：在整张图上拟合斜度，补上第一次漏掉的同步，弱信号的行也能接着解下去。很多时候这一步就够了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Decodes this picture again from its raw audio, with the timing you set: not an edit of the image, so nothing is stretched or made up." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按你设定的时序，用原始音频把这张图重新解码。这不是修图，没有任何拉伸或凭空生成。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Decoding the whole recording, as if it were played to Receive. The file itself isn't changed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在解码整段录音，就像把它放给“接收”听一样。原文件不会被改动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
