    },
    "Delete Synced, in the watch's Pictures, removes the pictures the iPhone already has. To keep less on the watch, turn off Save Raw Audio in the watch's Settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "手表“图片”里的“删除已同步的”会删除 iPhone 上已有的图片。想让手表上少存一些，可以在手表的“设置”里关闭“保存原始音频”。"
