          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Developed again, not edited" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "重新冲洗，而不是修图"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Does Apricot SSTV collect any data?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apricot SSTV 会收集数据吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Done" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "完成"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Done keeps it reverted; Cancel leaves the picture as it was. The raw audio stays, so it can be developed again at any time." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "点“完成”才会真正复原；点“取消”则保持原样。原始音频会保留，随时可以重新冲洗。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Done keeps the developed picture beside the original, which is never changed, and the raw audio stays. Revert to Original goes back at any time." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "点“完成”会把冲洗好的图片保存在原图旁边，原图永远不变，原始音频也保留。随时可以“复原为原图”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag across upright edges" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "拖出一个框，框住竖直的边"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag both marks onto one upright edge" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "把两个标记拖到同一条竖直的边上"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drag to move, pinch to zoom, double-tap to switch between fill and fit." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "拖移可移动，双指捏合可缩放，轻点两下可在填满与完整显示之间切换。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Drawn at the top left of every picture you send, to identify your station." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "画在每张发送图片的左上角，用来表明你的电台身份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each picture's details have room for its frequency, its source (a satellite, a callsign) and a note. They're kept apart from how it was received, which never changes." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每张图片的详情里可以填写频率、来源（卫星或呼号）和备注。它们和接收记录分开保存，接收记录本身永远不变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each picture's sound, from as long before it to as long after it as the picture takes to send, in case its start or end was misjudged. If a picture comes out badly, it can be developed again from this sound in the darkroom, or the sound shared. Without it, only the picture is left." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保存每张图片的声音，前后各多留一段与该图发送时长相同的余量，以防开头或结尾判断错。如果图片收得不好，可以在暗室里用这段声音重新冲洗，也可以把声音分享出去。不保存的话，就只剩下图片本身。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Edit" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "编辑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Edit Event" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "编辑活动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Either that mode isn't one of the 14 that Apricot SSTV handles, or you chose a single mode and this picture is a different one." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "要么这个模式不在 Apricot SSTV 支持的 14 种之内，要么你只选择了一种模式，而这张图片是别的模式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Encoding %@…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在编码 %@…"
          }
        }
