        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "活动：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Events" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "活动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every mode can be received and sent, with the VIS header or, when it was missed, from the line syncs." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每种模式都可以接收和发送；可以通过 VIS 头识别，漏掉 VIS 头时也可以通过行同步识别。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every saved picture goes to the iPhone by itself when the iPhone app is installed and the two are near each other. You don't need to open either app. Its raw audio follows, if saved. In the watch's Pictures, a phone icon marks the ones the iPhone already has in full." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只要 iPhone 上装了 App 且两台设备在附近，每张保存的图片都会自动传到 iPhone，无需打开任何一边的 App。如果保存了原始音频，音频会随后传过去。在手表的“图片”中，带手机图标的表示 iPhone 上已经全部有了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Export Library saves every picture with its details, notes and raw audio, your events and your favorites, as a folder in Files. Import Library takes such a folder back; pictures already here are skipped. To find pictures in a recording made elsewhere, use Decode Audio File in the ⋯ menu on Receive." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“导出资料库”会把所有图片及其接收信息、备注、原始音频，以及活动和常用图片，作为一个文件夹存到“文件”中。“导入资料库”可以把这样的文件夹导回来；已经有的图片会跳过。如果要从别处录下的录音里找图片，请用“接收”页 ⋯ 菜单里的“解码音频文件”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Export Library…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "导出资料库…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
