    "Input changed" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "输入设备已更改"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Interrupted" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已中断"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Interrupted by a new picture" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "被新图片打断"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Introduction" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "功能介绍"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Invalid picture ID" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无效的图片 ID"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iPhone" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iPhone"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iPod nano Version" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iPod nano 版"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ISS SSTV, a net, a test…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ISS SSTV、网络点名、测试…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It says a mode was skipped." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "提示某个模式被跳过了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its marks are the tones SSTV uses: 1200 Hz (sync), 1500 Hz (black), 1900 Hz (the VIS leader) and 2300 Hz (white). During a picture the marker moves between black and white; a steady 1900 Hz means a picture is about to start. Tuning errors up to ±150 Hz are corrected from the VIS header." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "刻度对应 SSTV 使用的音调：1200 Hz（同步）、1500 Hz（黑）、1900 Hz（VIS 引导音）和 2300 Hz（白）。接收图片时，标记在黑与白之间移动；稳定停在 1900 Hz 表示一张图片即将开始。±150 Hz 以内的调谐误差会根据 VIS 头自动校正。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its pictures stay, in no event." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "其中的图片会保留，不再属于任何活动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep each picture's sound. It goes to the iPhone with the picture, where a bad one can be developed again from it in the darkroom." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保存每张图片的声音。它会随图片传到 iPhone，收得不好的图片可以在暗室里用它重新冲洗。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep Listening" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "继续接收"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep Raw Audio?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保存原始音频吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep While Dimmed" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "暗屏时继续"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keeps the sound of each picture and sends it to the iPhone with the picture." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保存每张图片的声音，并随图片一起传到 iPhone。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keeps the sound of each picture with it as a WAV file, to share from the picture's details or develop again in the darkroom: from as long before the picture as it takes to send, to as long after it, in case its start or end was misjudged. 12 kHz holds everything the decoder uses: about 8 MB for a Martin M1 picture. Full Rate keeps the sound as it came in (usually 48 kHz), for other programs or for listening, at four times the size. A change takes effect the next time you tap Listen. Apple Watch has its own settings and always uses 12 kHz." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "把每张图片的声音作为 WAV 文件和图片一起保存，可以在图片详情里分享，或在暗室里重新冲洗：前后各多留一段与该图发送时长相同的余量，以防开头或结尾判断错。12 kHz 已包含解码器用到的全部信息，一张 Martin M1 约 8 MB。“完整采样率”按收到时的原样保存（通常是 48 kHz），适合交给其他软件或回放收听，体积是 4 倍。更改在下次点“收听”时生效。Apple Watch 有自己的设置，始终使用 12 kHz。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keeps the sound of each picture with it as a WAV file, to share from the picture's details or develop again in the darkroom. Apple Watch has its own settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "把每张图片的声音作为 WAV 文件和图片一起保存，可以在图片详情里分享，或在暗室里重新冲洗。Apple Watch 有自己的设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Last Day" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "最后一天"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Last picture" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "最近一张图片"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Length" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "时长"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Level" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "电平"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "License" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "许可证"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Line 0 starts at" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "第一行起点"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Line syncs (no VIS)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "行同步（无 VIS）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Listen" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "接收"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Listen, and Keep Listening with Wrist Down" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "接收，放下手腕也继续"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Listening" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在接收"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Listening carries on until you tap Stop, with the wrist down or in another app." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "放下手腕或打开别的 App 都继续接收，直到你轻点“停止”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Listening carries on with the wrist down, and stops when you leave the app, after the picture coming in." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "放下手腕时继续接收，离开 App 时停止；如果正在收图，等这张收完再停。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Listening stops when no picture has come in for this long, to save battery." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "超过这么久没有收到图片，就停止接收，以节省电量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Listening uses a lot of battery, so it stops when no picture has come in for the Receive Timeout in Settings (10 minutes at first), never in the middle of a picture. In its last two minutes a countdown shows, with Keep Listening to start it over. Choose Never to listen until you tap Stop." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "接收很耗电，所以超过“设置”中的“接收超时”（默认 10 分钟）没有收到图片时会自动停止，但不会在收图中途停止。最后两分钟会显示倒计时，轻点“继续接收”可以重新计时。选择“永不”则一直接收，直到你轻点“停止”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Listening…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在接收…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lock on to %@ line syncs when the VIS header was missed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "漏掉 VIS 头时，按 %@ 的行同步锁定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lock on to line syncs when the VIS header was missed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "漏掉 VIS 头时，按行同步锁定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lost" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "丢失"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lowering your wrist" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "放下手腕"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Make Current" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设为当前活动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Make it current, and pictures received from now on (here or on Apple Watch) go into it until the end of its last day." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设为当前活动后，从现在起收到的图片（无论在这台 iPhone 还是 Apple Watch 上）都会归入它，直到最后一天结束。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Making the WAV" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在生成 WAV"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Many apps straighten a picture by bending the image afterwards: pixels are slid, stretched and filled in, and whatever was lost stays lost. The darkroom works on the sound instead. It decodes the picture's raw audio again, reading every line at the timing you set, so nothing is stretched or made up: every pixel comes from the signal, as when the picture first came in." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "很多软件纠正图片的方法，是事后对图像本身做变形：把像素挪动、拉伸、补齐，丢掉的东西还是丢了。暗室处理的是声音：它把这张图的原始音频重新解码一遍，按你设定的时序重新读取每一行，所以没有任何拉伸或凭空生成，每个像素都和第一次收到时一样，来自信号本身。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Measuring" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "测量中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Microphone access is off. Turn it on in Settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "麦克风权限已关闭，请在“设置”中开启。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Missing" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "缺失"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mode" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "模式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Modes" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "模式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "More" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
