    "Syncs found" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "找到的同步"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap Listen. When a picture's VIS header is heard, the picture builds line by line, and it is saved to Pictures when it ends. You can lock the iPhone: receiving carries on." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "轻点“接收”。听到图片的 VIS 头后，图片会一行一行地出现，结束时自动存入“图片”。锁定 iPhone 后接收也会继续。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap Send. Receiving stops while sending. Keep the radio connected until the progress bar finishes; you can lock the iPhone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "轻点“发送”。发送时会停止接收。在进度条走完之前保持电台连接；可以锁定 iPhone。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap Send. The radio keys on VOX." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "轻点“发送”，电台由 VOX 自动发射。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap the picture or Adjust to move and zoom the photo in the frame." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "轻点图片或“调整位置和大小”，在画框中移动和缩放照片。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap to Listen" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "轻点开始接收"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Test Card" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "测试卡"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text on the picture" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "图片上的文字"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the chosen mode" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所选模式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the encoder failed" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "编码器出错"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file isn't a picture Apricot SSTV can read." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这个文件不是 Apricot SSTV 能读取的图片。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first time you open the app on the watch, you choose what lowering your wrist does: keep listening, or stop to save battery (after the picture coming in). Change it under Wrist Down in the watch's Settings, which are apart from the iPhone's. If it stopped, the reason stays on screen, with a button to listen again and keep listening from then on." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "第一次在手表上打开 App 时，你会选择放下手腕后怎么办：继续接收，或者停止以节省电量（正在收的图会先收完）。之后可以在手表“设置”的“放下手腕后”中更改，手表的设置和 iPhone 的分开。如果接收停了，原因会一直显示在屏幕上，旁边有一个按钮，可以重新接收并且从此放下手腕也继续。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The iPhone app must be installed, and the watch and iPhone near each other. Transfers wait and finish by themselves. Settings shows whether the watch app is installed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "需要 iPhone 上装有 App，并且手表和 iPhone 在附近。传输会自动等待并完成。“设置”里可以看到手表 App 是否已安装。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The picture is noisy or the colors are wrong." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "图片噪点多或颜色不对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The picture stays." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "图片会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The picture's raw audio, kept when Save Raw Audio is on (on the iPhone, and on the watch for its own pictures). A picture without it can still be shared, but not developed again. Open a picture and tap Edit, or Develop Again in the Darkroom." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "需要这张图的原始音频，在开启“保存原始音频”时保留（iPhone 和手表各有自己的开关）。没有原始音频的图片仍然可以分享，但不能重新冲洗。打开一张图片，点“编辑”或“在暗室中冲洗”即可进入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The pictures stay." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "图片会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The raw audio can't be read." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法读取原始音频。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The sound this picture was decoded from, as a WAV file. Share it to decode it again in another app." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "解码出这张图片的声音，保存为 WAV 文件。可以分享到其他 App 中重新解码。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The tuning bar" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "调谐条"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Then, from what Develop found: the mode, where the first line starts (a line at a time, or finely), the slant (the sender's clock error, set by hand or measured on the picture with two points on an upright edge or a region with upright edges) and the horizontal position. Every change is decoded again from the sound. Touch and hold the picture to compare with the picture as received." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "然后在冲洗的结果上继续调：模式、第一行起点（一行一行地移，或细调）、斜度（发送方的时钟偏差，可以手动设，也可以在图片上测：在一条竖直的边上放两个点，或框住一块有竖直边的区域）以及左右位置。每一次改动都会从声音重新解码。按住图片可以和收到时的原图对比。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They're in Pictures, each with its stretch of the recording as raw audio, to develop again in the darkroom. When they were received is worked out from the file's date." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它们已存进“图片”，每张都带着录音中属于自己的那一段作为原始音频，可以在暗室里重新冲洗。接收时间是根据文件的日期推算的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This event has ended. To add new pictures to it as they come in, change its last day." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这个活动已经结束。如果还想让新收到的图片自动归入，请修改它的最后一天。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This file can't be read as audio." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法把这个文件当作音频读取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This picture has no raw audio here, so it can't be developed again. If the watch kept it, it comes after the picture." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这张图片在这里还没有原始音频，所以不能重新冲洗。如果手表保存了，它会在图片之后传过来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This picture has no raw audio." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这张图片没有原始音频。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This picture isn't on the iPhone yet. Delete it?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这张图片还没传到 iPhone。要删除吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This picture was kept without its sound, so it can't be developed again. With Save Raw Audio on, new pictures keep theirs." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这张图片保存时没有保留声音，所以不能重新冲洗。开启“保存原始音频”后，新收到的图片会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This recording's sample rate is too low to decode SSTV." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这段录音的采样率太低，无法解码 SSTV。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To keep a picture here, choose Add to Favorites in the photo menu after placing it in the frame." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "要把图片放到这里，先把它放进画框，再在图片菜单中选择“添加到常用图片”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tone" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "音调"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Too few rows to count as a picture: mostly false starts, sometimes a picture caught at its very end. Each is kept with its raw audio (if saved), which may hold the whole picture: open one and Edit to develop it in the darkroom." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "行数太少、算不上一张图的片段：大多是误触发，有时是只赶上结尾的图片。每个片段都和它的原始音频（如果保存了）一起保留，音频里可能有整张图：打开它，点“编辑”，到暗室里重新冲洗。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Too loud: turn the radio down" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "太响了：请调低电台音量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Too loud: turn the radio down." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "太响了：请调低电台音量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Touch and hold the picture to see it as received." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按住图片可查看收到时的原样。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Touch and hold to see it as received." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按住可查看收到时的原样。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Transmitting needs an amateur radio license and must follow its rules, including identifying your station." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "发射需要业余无线电执照，并须遵守执照的相关规定，包括表明你的电台身份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tuning offset" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "调谐偏移"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn off fitting to set the sender's clock error yourself, when the fit leans the picture. Or measure it on the picture: put two marks on one edge that should be upright, or drag across a part with upright edges, and Apply." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果拟合出来的图是斜的，可以关闭拟合，自己设定发送方的时钟偏差；也可以直接在图片上测：把两个标记放到一条本该竖直的边上，或者框住一块有竖直边的地方，然后点“应用”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Two Points" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "两点测量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Undo" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "撤销"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unknown" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "未知"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Until you tap Stop, or no picture comes for the receive timeout." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "直到你轻点“停止”，或者超过接收超时还没有收到图片。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Untitled Event" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "未命名活动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uses the least space." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "占用空间最少。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Usually it's the level: too low lets noise in, too high (Clipping) distorts the tones. A cable or USB interface is much cleaner than a microphone held to a speaker." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "通常是电平问题：太低会混入噪声，太高（削波）会让音调失真。用连接线或 USB 声卡，比把麦克风对着扬声器干净得多。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "版本 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vertical Position" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "上下位置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "VIS header" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "VIS 头"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "等待 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for a picture" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "等待图片"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for VIS" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "等待 VIS"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Watch app not installed" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "手表 App 未安装"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Website" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "网站"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What It Does" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "功能"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What it needs" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "需要什么"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When the screen dims or you leave the app, listening stops, after the picture coming in. Saves the most battery." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "屏幕变暗或离开 App 时停止接收；如果正在收图，等这张收完再停。最省电。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where the picture's first line starts in the recording. Move it a line at a time if the top of the picture is missing or the picture starts too low." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "图片第一行在录音中的起点。如果图片顶部缺了一截，或者整张图偏下，可以一行一行地移动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With a new setup, tap the share button to make a WAV and decode it with another SSTV program, or play it to Apricot SSTV on Apple Watch." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用新设置时，先轻点分享按钮生成 WAV，用其他 SSTV 程序解码检查，或者放给 Apple Watch 上的 Apricot SSTV 接收。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With Save Raw Audio on, each picture keeps the sound it was decoded from, from as long before the picture to as long after it as the picture takes to send, so nothing is lost if its start or end was misjudged. Share it from the picture's details as a WAV file to decode it in another program, or to show someone what was received. Tapping Stop ends the recording there. Turn it off in Settings to save space." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开启“保存原始音频”后，每张图片都会保留解码它所用的声音：图片前后各多保存一张图的发送时长，就算图片的开头或结尾判断错了，声音也不会丢。可以在图片的详细信息中把它分享为 WAV 文件，用其他程序解码，或者让别人听听收到的是什么。轻点“停止”时录音也随之结束。想节省空间，可以在“设置”中关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With Start Without VIS on, a picture whose header was missed still starts after a few lines, from its line syncs." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打开“无 VIS 也开始”后，即使漏掉了 VIS 头，也会在几行之后根据行同步开始接收。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wrist Down" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "放下手腕后"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can change these in Settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "以后可以在“设置”中更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can change this in Settings at any time." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "随时可以在“设置”中更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Pictures" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的图片"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version" : "1.0"
}